font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나) 장소&nbsp;: 영남대학교 캠퍼스 전역</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 다) 세부일정 : 첨부파일\" 2013 국제공동 캡스톤 디자인 캠프 안내문\" 참고</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 참가신청 </font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 가) 참가대상 &nbsp;</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">＊ 우리학교 재학생 중 자작자동자 경험이 있거나 관련 동아리 활동 경험이 있는 학생</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">＊ 자동차 제작에 관심있는 학생</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">＊ 영어로 의사소통이 가능한 학생</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나) 참가인원 : 3명(인원 초과 시 학생들의 활동사항을 고려하여 선정)</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 다) 참가비용 : 없음</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; </font><font color=\"#ff00dd\">라) 신청기한 : 2013. 06.21(금)</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 마) 신청방법 : 첨부파일 \" 캠프참가신청